WHAT THIS REPOSITORY IS

This repository holds the source of djradu.com, the website of a working DJ.
It is public because GitHub Pages serves a site from a public repository on a
free account. Public visibility is not a licence, and nothing here is offered
as open source.


NO LICENCE IS GRANTED

No permission is given to use, copy, modify, adapt, translate, publish,
distribute, host, or create derivative works from any part of this repository,
in whole or in part, for any purpose, commercial or otherwise.

Under GitHub's Terms of Service, making a repository public grants other
GitHub users the right to view it and to fork it within GitHub. It grants
nothing beyond that. A fork does not carry permission to deploy, publish or
reuse this content, or any modified version of it, anywhere.


PHOTOGRAPHS

The photographs in this repository show events where DJ Radu performed and his
own sound and lighting equipment. They are protected by copyright and may not
be reproduced, or used to promote any other person or business, under any
circumstances. Using them to advertise another DJ or entertainment service
will be treated as infringement and reported to the host and to GitHub.


NAME AND IDENTITY

The name "DJ Radu", the logo, the CVR number, the address, the telephone
number and the email addresses in this repository identify one specific
business. They may not be used, imitated, or left standing in a copy of this
site.


MATERIAL BELONGING TO OTHERS

The customer reviews quoted on the site are the words of the people who wrote
them, published on Trustpilot and Google and reproduced here with attribution
and a note of the source. They are not covered by the copyright above, and are
not free to reuse either.


THIRD-PARTY RESOURCES

The pages load Font Awesome and Google Fonts from their providers' own CDNs.
Neither is copied into this repository, and each keeps its own licence. This
file does not apply to them.


PERMISSION

To ask about using anything here, write to info@djradu.com.


